    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.tag.budding": "晶体母岩",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.tag.budding.description": "能够缓慢生长晶簇的方块，以及可以加速这一过程的催生器",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.tag.accelerators": "催生器",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.tag.accelerators.description": "能够对相邻方块强制施加随机刻的机器",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.tag.machines": "机械",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.tag.machines.description": "用于采集和加工晶体的动力机器",
    
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.budding_growth.header": "母岩如何生长",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.budding_growth.text_1": "母岩只在随机刻落到自身时才会推进生长。随机刻稀少，且每次只有很小的概率推进一级。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.budding_growth.text_2": "催生器改变了这一点：每游戏刻，它都会对接触到的每个方块施加一次随机刻。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.budding_growth.text_3": "部分母岩另有条件：回响母岩需要无光，可燃冰母岩需要水，福鲁伊克斯母岩需要 AE 供电，石英与荧石母岩只在下界满速生长。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_electric.header": "电力催生器的供能",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_electric.text_1": "催生器分为电力与动力两种。这台电力催生器消耗 FE 能量，动力催生器消耗旋转力。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_electric.text_2": "通入 FE 后便会启动：每游戏刻，它都会对每个相邻方块施加一次随机刻。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_mechanical.header": "动力催生器的供能",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_mechanical.text_1": "这台动力催生器消耗旋转力，从背面接入。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_mechanical.text_2": "输入转速越慢，每秒施加的随机刻就越少。低转速下，一级生长仍需等待。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_mechanical.text_3": "提高输入转速后，同样的生长阶段瞬间即可完成。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_random_ticks.header": "随机刻还驱动什么",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_random_ticks.text_1": "随机刻驱动的远不止晶簇生长。作物、树苗等一切依赖随机刻的机制都会被加速。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.accelerator_random_ticks.text_2": "六个面会同时获得随机刻，因此一台催生器可以催生它周围的一切。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_speed.header": "普通采集",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_speed.text_1": "智能钻头是一台具有两种采集模式的机械钻头。本段讲普通采集。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_speed.text_2": "普通采集模式下，智能钻头的采集速度是普通钻头的两倍。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_modes.header": "切换模式",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_modes.text_1": "侧面的设置槽用于切换采集模式。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_modes.text_2": "精准采集模式下，采集速度与普通钻头相同：两台钻头同时挖穿方块。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_silk_touch.header": "采集母岩",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_silk_touch.text_1": "母岩是一个特例：普通钻头只会将其打碎，无法采集方块本身。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_silk_touch.text_2": "精准采集模式下，智能钻头能完整采下母岩方块本身。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_redstone.header": "受红石控制",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_redstone.text_1": "通入红石信号会锁住智能钻头：停止旋转，也停止采集，前方的方块一动不动。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_redstone.text_2": "撤掉信号，钻头立刻从原来的进度接着挖。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.smart_drill_redstone.text_3": "唯独它正对的那一面是例外：摆在正前方的红石信号不会锁住它，钻头照挖不误。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_airflow.header": "气流与收集",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_airflow.text_1": "动力吸尘器使用与鼓风机相同的气流。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_airflow.text_2": "落入气流范围或躺在它前方的物品，都会被吸入并存入自带的库存。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_container.header": "前方的容器",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_container.text_1": "摆在正前方的容器会被特殊对待：吸尘器直接与其交换物品，不会向世界掉落任何物品。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_container.text_2": "吸气模式下，它可以从容器中抽取符合条件的物品，收进自己的库存。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_container.text_3": "吹气模式下，库存中的物品会被送回前方的容器。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_config.header": "配置吸尘器",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_config.text_1": "过滤条件与传输数量由侧面的配置槽设置。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.cleaner_config.text_2": "气流方向则在吸尘器的界面里切换，物品的流向随之改变。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_table.header": "共振台",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_table.text_1": "共振台只能容纳一种物品。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_table.text_2": "右击将物品放到共振台上，再次右击取回。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_table.text_3": "侧面的滑块决定共振台可承载的物品数量，与弹射置物台同理。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_network.header": "使用多个共振台配置过滤",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_network.text_1": "手持共振台潜行右击已有的共振台，可将该网络复制到手中的物品上。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_network.text_2": "用它放置的每一张共振台都会加入同一网络，共同决定过滤。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_network.text_3": "空着的共振台直接不参与过滤。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_network.text_4": "只有网络里每一张共振台都空着时，过滤才不设限。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter.header": "自动化配置过滤",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter.text_1": "共振过滤器自身不存储规则：它读取所在网络中每一张共振台上的物品。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter.text_2": "只有网络放行的物品才过得去。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter.text_3": "更换共振台上的物品，过滤结果随之改变。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_types.header": "列表过滤器与属性过滤器",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_types.text_1": "共振台也接受列表过滤器，它装着的物品都放行。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_types.text_2": "共振台也接受属性过滤器，匹配到这些属性的物品都放行。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_redstone.header": "冻结过滤",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_redstone.text_1": "向共振台输入红石信号会冻结它的过滤。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_redstone.text_2": "网络将始终按充能瞬间台面物品的副本判定。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_filter_redstone.text_3": "撤掉信号后，过滤重新跟随共振台。",

    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_display.header": "在显示器上读取网络",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_display.text_1": "接在共振台上的显示链接器会读取整个网络的过滤内容。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_display.text_2": "链接器把这份列表发送给它指向的翻牌显示器，每行一个物品。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.resonance_display.text_3": "列表涵盖网络中的每一张共振台，多一张共振台就多一行。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_heating.header": "让工作盆开工",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_heating.text_1": "智能温控室把工作盆调到配方所需的温度，加热与冷却都照做。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_heating.text_2": "燃料是可燃冰沙，用桶倒进去或由管道送入。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_heating.text_3": "烧着的时候，工作盆不再理会配方要求的热量条件，直接开工。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_heating.text_4": "可燃冰沙烧完后，温控室熄灭，工作盆随之停工。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_sharing.header": "共享容量",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_sharing.text_1": "摆在一起的温控室共享容量，容量随这一组的台数叠加。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_sharing.text_2": "燃料倒进其中任意一台，整组会同时烧起来。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_sharing.text_3": "相邻的几台之间不再有边框，连成一片后如同一台机器。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_boiler.header": "蒸汽锅炉的热源",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_boiler.text_1": "温控室也能作为蒸汽锅炉的热源。",
    "create_crystal_industry.ponder.temperature_chamber_boiler.text_2": "热量与烈焰人燃烧室的满热档相同，燃料烧完就停。",

    "item.create_crystal_industry.night_vision_goggles.tooltip.summary": "经传统护目镜改装而来, 具有夜视功能, 按_[%s]_启用",
    
    "item.create_crystal_industry.echo_spyglass.tooltip.summary": "经传统望远镜改装而来, 使用时使视线穿过障碍, 以轮廓形式看见方块. ",
    "item.create_crystal_industry.echo_spyglass.tooltip.note": "'合法矿透'",
    
